window.DINHNGHIA={"a": "one; used before a singular noun", "about": "on the subject of", "access": "The way or right to get into a place or use something.", "activity": "something that people do for fun, interest or a purpose", "admit": "To agree that something is true, often something bad.", "advantage": "something good that helps you or makes something better", "afford": "To have enough money or time for something.", "after": "later than something", "ages": "different ages of people; 'for ages' means for a very long time", "airport": "a place where planes take off and land", "all": "the whole number or amount of something", "allergic": "Becoming ill when you eat or touch something.", "am": "the form of 'be' used with 'I'", "amazing": "Very surprising and wonderful.", "ambitious": "Wanting very much to be successful.", "an": "one; used before a vowel sound", "and": "used to join two words or ideas", "animations": "Films made with moving drawings or computer images.", "answer": "something you say or write when someone asks a question", "anybody": "Any person (often in questions and negatives).", "app": "a computer program, especially one on a smartphone", "are": "a form of 'be' used with you, we and they", "around": "on every side of something; also 'about' or 'near'", "arrive": "to get to a place", "as": "used to say what job or role someone has; also 'because' or 'while'", "asked": "said or wrote a question; told someone you want something", "at": "used to show a place or a time", "attraction": "an interesting place that many people visit", "attract": "to make people want to come to or look at something", "bay": "a part of the sea that is partly surrounded by land", "be": "to exist; used to describe someone or something", "beneficial": "Good or helpful.", "between": "in the space that separates two things or people", "bit": "a small amount (a bit = a little)", "boat": "a small vehicle that travels on water", "border": "The line between two countries; the edge of something.", "box": "a container with flat sides, used to keep things in", "boy": "a male child or young man", "british": "From or connected with Britain.", "but": "used to join two ideas that are different", "buy": "to get something by paying money for it", "by": "used to show who did something, or how something is done", "c": "the third letter of the English alphabet, used to label a choice", "calendar": "a page or set of pages showing the days, weeks and months of a year", "can": "to be able to do something", "can't": "short form of cannot: not able to", "celebration": "A special event for an important day or success.", "chi": "a common name for a Vietnamese girl", "chips": "long thin pieces of fried potato (British English)", "choose": "to pick one from several things", "city": "a large and important town", "class": "a group of students who learn together", "climbers": "People who climb mountains or rocks.", "com": "the last part of many website and email addresses", "community": "the people who live in the same area", "company": "a business that makes or sells things", "complete": "to finish; to fill in all the parts", "conservative": "Not liking new ideas or changes.", "continued": "Past tense of continue.", "cooperation": "Working together.", "correct": "right or true, without any mistakes", "could": "past form of can; used to ask politely", "course": "a set of lessons; 'of course' means certainly", "cross": "to go from one side of a road or river to the other", "d": "the fourth letter of the English alphabet, used as a label", "day": "a period of 24 hours", "delicious": "having a very pleasant taste or smell", "dictionary": "A book or app that explains the meanings of words.", "did": "past form of do; also used to make past questions", "different": "not the same as another person or thing", "do": "to perform an action; used to make questions", "does": "a form of 'do' used with he, she and it", "door": "the part of a room or building you open to go in or out", "downloaded": "Copied a file from the Internet.", "each": "every one of two or more people or things, seen separately", "easy": "not difficult to do or understand", "education": "the process of teaching and learning", "electronic": "Using computer chips or electronics.", "english": "the language of England, the USA and other countries", "enter": "To come or go into a place; to take part in.", "everything": "all things, or all the things in a situation", "excellent": "very, very good", "facilities": "Buildings or equipment provided for a particular purpose.", "famous": "Known by many people.", "fan": "An object you wave to make cool air; also a keen supporter.", "fantastic": "Very good.", "father": "Your male parent.", "fauna": "All the animals living in an area.", "field": "An area of open land for crops, animals or sports.", "fireworks": "Things that explode in the sky with bright colours.", "first": "Coming before all the others in time or order.", "fish": "An animal that lives and swims in water.", "fixed": "Repaired; (adj) not changing.", "flora": "All the plants of an area.", "following": "Coming next, or listed after this.", "founded": "Started an organisation, a school or a company.", "friendly": "kind and nice to other people", "from": "used to show where something starts", "get": "To receive something, or to become or arrive.", "girl": "A female child or young woman.", "guide": "A person who shows the way; a book of information.", "had": "Past form of have.", "has": "a form of 'have' used with he, she and it", "have": "to own or hold something", "he": "a word for a boy or a man", "he's": "he is", "helpful": "Useful, or always ready to help other people.", "helps": "makes it easier for someone to do something", "her": "a word for a girl or a woman; belonging to her", "hi": "An informal word you say when you meet someone.", "his": "belonging to a boy or a man", "historic": "Important in history.", "ho": "Part of the name Ho Chi Minh City, the biggest city in Viet Nam.", "hoa": "A Vietnamese girl's name.", "holiday": "A time when you do not go to school or work.", "i": "the word you use for yourself", "i'm": "I am", "if": "Used to say that one thing happens when another thing happens.", "in": "inside something", "includes": "has something as one part of the whole", "indian": "From or connected with India.", "interested": "Wanting to know or learn more about something.", "international": "Connected with two or more countries.", "is": "a form of 'be' used with he, she and it", "it": "a word for a thing or an animal", "itinerary": "A plan of a journey, with places and times.", "its": "Belonging to a thing, an animal or a place already mentioned.", "jane": "A girl's name.", "join": "to come and do something together with other people", "k": "The eleventh letter of the English alphabet.", "know": "To have information about something or someone.", "l": "The twelfth letter of the English alphabet.", "landscape": "Everything you can see when you look across a large area of land.", "language": "The words and system people use to speak and write.", "last": "The one before this one, or coming after all others.", "learn": "to get new knowledge or skills", "limited": "Small in amount; not very much.", "linda": "a girl's name", "listen": "to pay attention to sounds or to what someone says", "lives": "third person form of live: has his or her home in a place", "local": "belonging to or connected with the area where you live", "located": "In a particular place.", "london": "the capital city of England and the United Kingdom", "look": "to turn your eyes towards something; to seem", "lot": "a lot of: a large number or amount of something", "m": "short form of 'am', used after I, as in I'm", "made": "past form of make: produced or created something", "magnificent": "Extremely beautiful and impressive.", "many": "a large number of", "mark": "to put a sign or colour on something to show it is important", "me": "used as the object form of I", "meet": "to come together with someone", "met": "Past form of meet.", "mount": "Used in the names of mountains, written Mt.", "mountain": "A very high hill.", "mountains": "very high hills", "ms": "a title used before a woman's name, married or not", "my": "belonging to me", "n": "the letter n of the English alphabet", "nation": "A country and its people.", "native": "Connected with the place where you were born.", "next": "coming straight after; beside (next to)", "no": "used to give a negative answer", "not": "used to make a sentence negative", "number": "a word or sign like 1, 2 or 3", "nutritious": "Good for your health and growth.", "of": "belonging to; part of", "on": "touching the top of something; used before days and dates", "one": "the number 1", "only": "no more than; nobody or nothing else", "open": "to make something not closed", "or": "used to show another possibility", "organised": "Well planned and tidy; also past form of organise.", "our": "Belonging to us, the speaker and other people.", "p": "In 'p.m.', used after a time to show it is after midday.", "package": "Something wrapped in paper or put in a box to send.", "paddy": "A field where rice is grown.", "pair": "Two people or things that are together.", "path": "A narrow way for walking.", "people": "men, women and children", "person": "A man, woman or child.", "phrases": "Plural of phrase: small groups of words used together.", "pick": "To choose something, or to take fruit or flowers from a plant.", "pilot": "A person who flies a plane.", "place": "A particular area, building or position.", "placed": "Put something in a particular position.", "plane": "A vehicle with wings that flies.", "positioned": "Put in a particular place.", "prepare": "to get ready for something", "price": "The money you pay for something.", "prize": "Something given to a person who wins a competition.", "promotes": "Helps something grow or become popular.", "pronoun": "A word like he, she, it, they used instead of a noun.", "pronunciation": "The way a word is said.", "quality": "How good or bad something is.", "questions": "things you ask to get information", "r": "The letter r.", "rainforest": "A thick forest in a hot place with a lot of rain.", "re": "The short form of 'are' after we, you or they.", "relative": "A member of your family.", "remember": "To keep something in your mind or bring it back to your mind.", "repeat": "To say or do something again.", "report": "To tell people about something you have found or seen.", "restaurant": "A place where you buy and eat meals.", "rewrite": "To write something again in a different or better way.", "rich": "Having a lot of money; or having a lot of something.", "seafood": "Fish and other sea animals that people eat.", "sentence": "a group of words that expresses a complete idea", "sentences": "groups of words that express complete ideas", "serves": "The he/she/it form of 'serve'.", "services": "Jobs or systems that help people or provide what they need.", "she": "a word for a girl or a woman", "skyscrapers": "Very tall buildings.", "slow": "Not moving or happening quickly.", "snack": "A small amount of food between meals.", "some": "a number of; a few", "soon": "In a short time from now.", "speaker": "A person who speaks; a machine that makes sound louder.", "speakers": "People who speak; machines that make sound louder.", "speaks": "Says words; uses a language.", "speciality": "a food or product that a place is famous for", "stress": "a feeling of worry because of problems or too much work", "students": "people who are studying at a school", "summer": "the hottest season of the year", "sure": "certain that something is true", "t": "the last letter of n't, the short form of 'not'", "teacher": "a person whose job is to teach", "teaches": "gives lessons (used with he, she, it)", "telephone": "A machine you use to talk to people far away.", "that": "used for a thing further away; used to join ideas", "the": "used before a noun when we know which one", "their": "belonging to or connected with them", "them": "a word for people or things (after a verb)", "there": "in or at that place; used with 'be' to say something exists", "these": "used for people or things near you (plural of this)", "they": "a word for two or more people or things", "this": "used for a thing near you", "those": "Used for people or things that are far from you (plural).", "to": "towards; used before a verb", "tomorrow": "on the day after today", "top": "most important; highest in rank", "tour": "A trip to visit different places.", "touring": "Travelling around a place.", "tourism": "The business of providing services for tourists.", "tourist": "a person who visits a place for fun", "trekkers": "People who walk long distances, often in mountains.", "try": "To make an effort to do something, or to test something.", "underlined": "With a line drawn under it.", "understand": "To know what something means or how it works.", "unit": "One of the parts that a textbook is divided into.", "up": "Towards a higher place or position.", "useful": "Helping you to do or get what you want.", "using": "The -ing form of 'use': doing something with a thing for a purpose.", "v": "A short form of 'verb' used in grammar patterns.", "varieties": "Different types of something.", "very": "used to make a word stronger", "vi": "Part of the name Ba Vi, a mountain area near Ha Noi.", "view": "What you can see from a place; an opinion.", "village": "A very small town in the countryside.", "visit": "To go to see a person or place for a short time.", "voyage": "A long journey, especially by sea.", "wanted": "past tense of want", "was": "Past form of 'be' used with I, he, she, it and singular nouns.", "way": "A method of doing something, or a road to a place.", "we": "a word for you and me together", "week": "A period of seven days.", "were": "Past form of 'be' used with you, we, they and plural nouns.", "when": "At the time that something happens.", "whether": "Used to talk about a choice between two possibilities.", "which": "used to ask about one of a group", "who": "Used to ask or talk about which person.", "whose": "Used to ask or say who something belongs to.", "will": "Used to talk about the future.", "with": "together with; having", "won": "Past form of 'win': was the best in a game or competition.", "word": "A single unit of language that has a meaning.", "words": "Single units of language that have meanings.", "world": "The earth with all its countries and people.", "would": "Used to ask or say what someone wants, or what is possible.", "write": "to put words on paper or a screen", "y": "The letter Y, used in the spelling rule 'ie' to 'y' + -ing.", "yes": "used to give a positive answer", "yesterday": "On the day before today.", "you": "The person or people that someone is speaking to.", "your": "belonging to you"};
window.EXAUD={"Students have access to the library.": "audio/cau/96291a95352cbb8d.mp3", "I can access the Internet at home.": "audio/cau/79f14e4aa5fdf467.mp3", "Swimming is my favourite activity.": "audio/cau/f1504092a266a13a.mp3", "Hoa is an active girl, and dancing is her best activity.": "audio/cau/3d7dcf03c6c96451.mp3", "He admitted breaking the window.": "audio/cau/14f79d8b1999fc01.mp3", "I admit that I was wrong.": "audio/cau/b79105028679a492.mp3", "One advantage of city life is good transport.": "audio/cau/9fc77e303de2b98e.mp3", "Living in the city has an advantage and a disadvantage.": "audio/cau/059e2e89f7212162.mp3", "We can't afford a new car.": "audio/cau/7898fc808d5042fd.mp3", "Can you afford this phone?": "audio/cau/4b9bd30e678c330b.mp3", "The fair is fun for people of all ages.": "audio/cau/2c3d7842ba50424f.mp3", "I haven't seen my cousin for ages.": "audio/cau/03e090874bec6143.mp3", "Noi Bai Airport is in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/282019109c12eb03.mp3", "We took a taxi to the airport to catch our plane.": "audio/cau/e094ed7f1a8da89a.mp3", "I am allergic to seafood.": "audio/cau/91c901ad75f875fb.mp3", "Is he allergic to cats?": "audio/cau/514be3e1390d7161.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is amazing.": "audio/cau/94ed67ada3a0dcec.mp3", "What an amazing show!": "audio/cau/ec1c0446de9b7767.mp3", "She is an ambitious student.": "audio/cau/56efb075ab3c0768.mp3", "This is an ambitious plan.": "audio/cau/01936aeb3fa2555b.mp3", "Japanese animations are popular.": "audio/cau/be8eb00c9de7262e.mp3", "He makes animations on his computer.": "audio/cau/c39e19ba4982e2f2.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "I use an app to learn English.": "audio/cau/8b5de3a8ea891fe1.mp3", "Lan downloaded a new app; this application helps her book taxis.": "audio/cau/1b345290c5e399e1.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "What time does the bus arrive at school?": "audio/cau/6222580dc0b6be13.mp3", "We arrived in Da Nang at night; our arrival was late.": "audio/cau/12e29a0ec6a17bbc.mp3", "Nam asked his teacher a question.": "audio/cau/4879a0b703b8484f.mp3", "Mi asks a lot of questions; yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/1884bf7fdb16c86c.mp3", "Hoan Kiem Lake is a popular attraction.": "audio/cau/94088e7e8cf750d8.mp3", "The night market attracts tourists and is a big attraction.": "audio/cau/5a512b8768f85428.mp3", "Beautiful beaches attract many tourists.": "audio/cau/4c43d9d7afbbf365.mp3", "Ha Long Bay attracts visitors because it is a famous attraction.": "audio/cau/aeb486068ea88223.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is a World Heritage Site.": "audio/cau/5a085a89254963b8.mp3", "There are thousands of islands in the bay.": "audio/cau/4cf873f6cc8fd985.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Exercise is beneficial to your health.": "audio/cau/dec8dafceb02534c.mp3", "Reading is beneficial for children.": "audio/cau/3dbddb3577468040.mp3", "I'm a bit tired today.": "audio/cau/42f3919d01ac7e5d.mp3", "Phong is a bit shy, but a little more confident now.": "audio/cau/8a006479d73a2609.mp3", "My grandpa goes to the market by boat.": "audio/cau/144e963c57b5e9ec.mp3", "There are many boats on the Mekong River.": "audio/cau/b99180aa114c4718.mp3", "Lang Son is near the Chinese border.": "audio/cau/0edb582fb1ab073e.mp3", "The card has a gold border.": "audio/cau/195ec3816246723b.mp3", "There is a cat in the box.": "audio/cau/2e85eeb9526b3b0e.mp3", "Put the toys in the box; we have three boxes.": "audio/cau/94612872a7e7c8fc.mp3", "The boy next to Mi is my brother.": "audio/cau/2b8e169ba1253282.mp3", "There are ten boys and twelve girls in my class.": "audio/cau/f109fb5b9db06caa.mp3", "Big Ben is a famous British landmark.": "audio/cau/25cdb4cf520b82a1.mp3", "British people often talk about the weather.": "audio/cau/7c291af5d4779ae9.mp3", "I want to buy a new lamp for my room.": "audio/cau/f0b3e6851a8b52eb.mp3", "Mum bought a sofa, and Dad wants to sell the old one.": "audio/cau/59add360cbe991b8.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "Mai writes her exam dates on a calendar.": "audio/cau/4be295f22474d7c1.mp3", "If you use a calendar, you can plan your work ahead.": "audio/cau/fdaab70daba68cf2.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "I can't find my pencil case.": "audio/cau/eb6d0d717595fc1e.mp3", "Nam can swim, but he can't play the guitar.": "audio/cau/7d46b51b1e362522.mp3", "There is a big celebration at school today.": "audio/cau/3d3aa53ce81957d2.mp3", "Tết is the biggest celebration in Việt Nam.": "audio/cau/1efe51c74833d817.mp3", "Chips are junk food.": "audio/cau/0484c3114a2ed1a3.mp3", "Bin eats chips only at weekends.": "audio/cau/2c3dbe167902352d.mp3", "Choose the correct answer.": "audio/cau/9bb3b69b3f099527.mp3", "Mi chose a red pen. It was a good choice.": "audio/cau/4fabb83c5ec962f5.mp3", "I live in a big city.": "audio/cau/66e0022bec290560.mp3", "Life in the city is busier than in the countryside.": "audio/cau/ec0678a3bad99639.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "The climbers reached the top at noon.": "audio/cau/a2f7f281ebe4e467.mp3", "Climbers need strong ropes.": "audio/cau/1938c99ae9d17cfa.mp3", "Her email address ends in .com.": "audio/cau/20e848f753e16e67.mp3", "My email is nam@mail.com; we say 'nam at mail dot com'.": "audio/cau/eb39c1a3fa32e965.mp3", "Our community has a new library.": "audio/cau/7685676fa4ede1ca.mp3", "People in my community help each other.": "audio/cau/3abacee40ff72839.mp3", "She works for a computer company.": "audio/cau/dbaa7b1a7f381505.mp3", "His company is now a big business.": "audio/cau/8c1460aeda0ca27f.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "My grandpa has conservative ideas.": "audio/cau/d674b7114fc7d372.mp3", "She wears conservative clothes.": "audio/cau/552a76b764565332.mp3", "She continued her work after lunch.": "audio/cau/5b925809c3cbf170.mp3", "The game continued after the rain.": "audio/cau/b2a3bdea1f6bd769.mp3", "Thanks for your cooperation.": "audio/cau/d29faba5310e58c1.mp3", "Teamwork needs good cooperation.": "audio/cau/8818c86d83457bf4.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "Could you tell me the way to the market?": "audio/cau/caec542f1754918b.mp3", "I can swim now, but I could not swim last year.": "audio/cau/15650b94c8bd4313.mp3", "Of course, I can help you.": "audio/cau/fd7c10e38552c9bd.mp3", "Mi is taking a cooking course this summer.": "audio/cau/29a5261c025cf175.mp3", "Look left and right before you cross the road.": "audio/cau/ab3734d3c0b8be05.mp3", "Minh crosses the street at the zebra crossing.": "audio/cau/7bcca857b74d8810.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "Hoa's mother cooks delicious pho.": "audio/cau/8a832f4b8fdda704.mp3", "If I have all the ingredients, I can make a delicious pizza.": "audio/cau/5f9d8db4e0198b83.mp3", "Look up the word in the dictionary.": "audio/cau/5c56b585dc46029a.mp3", "I have an English dictionary on my phone.": "audio/cau/b0b7b4c2f8c39ef8.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Please close the door when you leave.": "audio/cau/afff0ef664915359.mp3", "Our house has a big front door and a small gate.": "audio/cau/609f4be9be5f1a33.mp3", "She downloaded a new game yesterday.": "audio/cau/6211cada4a9342cb.mp3", "I downloaded the lesson to study at home.": "audio/cau/15bd67c4ef1f1dc1.mp3", "Do exercise e on page ten.": "audio/cau/f397a6a2157f10ba.mp3", "The word 'eye' starts with the letter e.": "audio/cau/5f2132c30b4b4b2f.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "Education is important for everyone.": "audio/cau/5d6f4743dd6ecbfa.mp3", "This educational game is good for children's education.": "audio/cau/f45236ae6a0aab5e.mp3", "Students use electronic dictionaries.": "audio/cau/c1fbdb9a3ad5439b.mp3", "Too many electronic devices are bad for kids.": "audio/cau/2e57798310313754.mp3", "We have English on Monday.": "audio/cau/6e580c9a3bf7deb6.mp3", "Nam wants to study English in England.": "audio/cau/babe058c930ffd1c.mp3", "Please knock before you enter the room.": "audio/cau/61a511eda76d4df9.mp3", "She entered a singing contest.": "audio/cau/abceda7a6a792ac7.mp3", "Hoa is excellent at managing her time.": "audio/cau/de820656572c573c.mp3", "Minh got an excellent mark in the English test.": "audio/cau/68dcd9cc4329d16b.mp3", "Our community has good sports facilities.": "audio/cau/e83f70ee03b94015.mp3", "The new library is a great facility for students.": "audio/cau/a744c2e83d2ff335.mp3", "Hoi An is famous for its lanterns.": "audio/cau/be0831db3c3bf621.mp3", "General Giap became famous, and his fame spread worldwide.": "audio/cau/4eabd5e77fd10a06.mp3", "My grandma makes a paper fan by hand.": "audio/cau/ff49f1da88c96a8f.mp3", "Nam is a big football fan.": "audio/cau/538c501bdd9f21e4.mp3", "We had a fantastic holiday.": "audio/cau/f32cf4ee7488001e.mp3", "The view from the top is fantastic.": "audio/cau/e447250983ededde.mp3", "My father is a doctor in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ad3b88cec9d38c40.mp3", "Hoa's father and grandfather are both farmers.": "audio/cau/86e9c9df994f954c.mp3", "Cuc Phuong has rich flora and fauna.": "audio/cau/87d03299c18782ab.mp3", "We studied the fauna of the island.": "audio/cau/078d5ba034c4518a.mp3", "The children are flying kites in the field.": "audio/cau/cbc154160546b20b.mp3", "Farmers grow rice in the fields near our village.": "audio/cau/37cf9b7ad781c0dc.mp3", "We watched fireworks on New Year's Eve.": "audio/cau/a91e8e4be5978745.mp3", "The fireworks lit up the sky.": "audio/cau/4de7597d360bcc19.mp3", "We buy fresh fish at the market.": "audio/cau/1e1bd5d1bfbdcbed.mp3", "Grandpa goes fishing and catches three fish.": "audio/cau/82e6c573c6d91dda.mp3", "He fixed the TV yesterday.": "audio/cau/58d6e539bf9cd341.mp3", "The shop has fixed prices.": "audio/cau/c980332656df9ebd.mp3", "The island has unique flora.": "audio/cau/2e77145d46a810a2.mp3", "We study the flora of the national park.": "audio/cau/cce66e7d7b3b5060.mp3", "Answer the following questions.": "audio/cau/7a648aa7c194b903.mp3", "We followed the plan the following day.": "audio/cau/f2e1b58551411942.mp3", "Our school was founded in 1990.": "audio/cau/d7fcea3da656abd7.mp3", "Mr Minh is the founder; he founded the company in 2005.": "audio/cau/3cf5016d01c4e24c.mp3", "Our new teacher is very friendly.": "audio/cau/0062f01a22f8a341.mp3", "Nam is friendly and has many friends.": "audio/cau/1865a7313d83db0c.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "The girl in the red dress is my sister.": "audio/cau/5c0a090c7edf82c5.mp3", "There are fifteen girls and twenty boys in my class.": "audio/cau/6f902e1712b320f2.mp3", "Our tour guide was very friendly.": "audio/cau/fe007de5a7686bd6.mp3", "Can you guide us around the museum?": "audio/cau/f51f756270e3a8df.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "Nam helps his father in the garden.": "audio/cau/872717d07d581517.mp3", "Lan is helpful, and she likes to help her friends.": "audio/cau/1681abe8d625bbeb.mp3", "Hoi An is a historic town.": "audio/cau/8866bea83dad139b.mp3", "We visited a historic building.": "audio/cau/1726fcbf4b6d8e27.mp3", "We visited Hoi An during the summer holiday.": "audio/cau/578987a30e37dfd7.mp3", "Lan went on holiday to Da Lat last year.": "audio/cau/f422a8ac4b914b70.mp3", "This unit includes words for rooms.": "audio/cau/3c431631cae782bc.mp3", "The price includes breakfast.": "audio/cau/f6bb53ddad085dc4.mp3", "I love Indian food.": "audio/cau/991f0ecda833071c.mp3", "Our new friend is Indian.": "audio/cau/5138e82243006f6a.mp3", "She was interested in science from an early age.": "audio/cau/34d48dff42b1323f.mp3", "Lan is interested in the book because it is interesting.": "audio/cau/916ab5cb0684d54c.mp3", "English is an international language.": "audio/cau/40571347e9372f5c.mp3", "Noi Bai is an international airport.": "audio/cau/30892f46c587c1e3.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "Here is the itinerary for our trip to Hue.": "audio/cau/ab9d7f026b450182.mp3", "The guide changed the itinerary because of rain.": "audio/cau/d753dff59a71c534.mp3", "We're playing badminton. Do you want to join us, Hoa?": "audio/cau/463866c7dddbef43.mp3", "Nam joined the school football club last year.": "audio/cau/706eaa16ea8a910a.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "Do you know his life story?": "audio/cau/db0ea43493818ad0.mp3", "I know her well; I knew her at primary school.": "audio/cau/26baffaf9e8a0ddb.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "The landscape in Ha Giang is amazing.": "audio/cau/0482f8706ad33e57.mp3", "He likes painting landscapes.": "audio/cau/c0f3081ea9bbe7de.mp3", "Minh speaks two languages: Vietnamese and English.": "audio/cau/fe1357c5277b08ec.mp3", "I visited my grandparents last weekend.": "audio/cau/553e8bea75bbdbbd.mp3", "Last Sunday was fun, and next Sunday will be fun too.": "audio/cau/17be93822cc3c397.mp3", "We learn English at school.": "audio/cau/9bc26f3d76057248.mp3", "Nam wants to learn to swim, and his sister learnt last year.": "audio/cau/5a7392296080d626.mp3", "We have limited time, so be quick.": "audio/cau/0d562bde03594f6c.mp3", "Water is a limited resource.": "audio/cau/eba5d63011ec9464.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My cousin lives in a flat in the city centre.": "audio/cau/6c1c9af9fa483b7a.mp3", "Lan lives in Da Nang, and her grandparents live in Hoi An.": "audio/cau/cad509dd3acaf3f4.mp3", "Bat Trang pottery is a famous local product.": "audio/cau/ea08f150b9375ac4.mp3", "Many locals buy food from local farmers at the market.": "audio/cau/dfc3f008f3837ff1.mp3", "My school is located near the park.": "audio/cau/ba1aab8aab45e1d3.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is located in Quang Ninh.": "audio/cau/c34453878ec32757.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Mai has a lot of friends at school.": "audio/cau/5010f52a3a68ba0b.mp3", "Minh reads a lot, and he has lots of books.": "audio/cau/356256a0d64c06ca.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "The view from the mountain is magnificent.": "audio/cau/62357d4e3aee9fd1.mp3", "Hue has many magnificent palaces.": "audio/cau/c877e24b8f8a5e46.mp3", "Hoa uses red to mark exam days on her calendar.": "audio/cau/78135abe90fe0ad6.mp3", "Nam marks his due dates with a yellow pen.": "audio/cau/9321f43accfdd88b.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai!": "audio/cau/fd0dc2a69403ef29.mp3", "I met Lan yesterday, and we will meet again tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1a3d6fe8e8cf61b9.mp3", "I met my teacher at the market.": "audio/cau/8e71521bc85f2a3d.mp3", "We met a lot of new friends.": "audio/cau/21fe179c5e79142a.mp3", "Mount Everest is the highest mountain.": "audio/cau/9d438a1d616fc420.mp3", "They climbed Mount Fuji last year.": "audio/cau/c36d5eee637ee0bf.mp3", "We climbed the mountain on Sunday.": "audio/cau/3540fe0a0191a696.mp3", "There is snow on the mountain.": "audio/cau/d6fce88f07e19286.mp3", "Sa Pa has beautiful mountains.": "audio/cau/88d0627a7afe738f.mp3", "We climbed a mountain in a mountainous area.": "audio/cau/86fe451e9e747ae3.mp3", "Ms Hoa teaches us maths.": "audio/cau/f0b35b8376d075b8.mp3", "Ms Lan and Mr Phong are our class teachers.": "audio/cau/6709f6324593fcc8.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "Viet Nam is a nation of 54 ethnic groups.": "audio/cau/fc0377b6b344369a.mp3", "The whole nation celebrates Tet.": "audio/cau/bde6381a94c2d89f.mp3", "Our English teacher is a native speaker.": "audio/cau/af80718a6347f5a4.mp3", "Bamboo is native to Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/4e82566b2a1c60d5.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "What is your phone number?": "audio/cau/bb5a84e5f55e9ae8.mp3", "Seven is my favourite number of all the numbers.": "audio/cau/d25e38b724724a81.mp3", "Milk is very nutritious.": "audio/cau/32a6a0d71c4a2da6.mp3", "We should eat nutritious food.": "audio/cau/882cd8fc95e8e540.mp3", "There is only one bed in my bedroom.": "audio/cau/000e91b12face3a4.mp3", "Lan is an only child; she has just one cousin.": "audio/cau/b6ec9a93c21bdf30.mp3", "Please open your books to page twenty.": "audio/cau/53593951c79684b4.mp3", "Open the window, but close the door.": "audio/cau/7aa87d369a509fca.mp3", "Our school organised a book fair.": "audio/cau/b8e5335267df2055.mp3", "She is a very organised student.": "audio/cau/78dd6fbd6335576d.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "I got a package from my aunt.": "audio/cau/3f50f697aa87ddc5.mp3", "The package arrived this morning.": "audio/cau/52e8828546756676.mp3", "Farmers work in the paddy fields.": "audio/cau/ffa77b353e768107.mp3", "The paddy fields turn yellow in autumn.": "audio/cau/99aa4775910a6cae.mp3", "I need a new pair of shoes for school.": "audio/cau/250c1c4ccfb0d448.mp3", "Find a partner and work in pairs.": "audio/cau/9f9cc8d6f86e7886.mp3", "Follow the path to the lake.": "audio/cau/a292396dcc067c9b.mp3", "There is a path through the forest.": "audio/cau/a40866393ab3a557.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "Use these phrases in your presentation.": "audio/cau/4f40d1db291eb325.mp3", "Write one phrase from the box, then add two more phrases.": "audio/cau/f53433a3dd4c0563.mp3", "Pick a card, please.": "audio/cau/1e4e9d51e347aede.mp3", "We pick tea leaves in the morning.": "audio/cau/c487a2bfd0d8d890.mp3", "My brother wants to be a pilot.": "audio/cau/a71dd13124f08a3b.mp3", "The pilot landed the plane safely.": "audio/cau/b7ff24eb517ca940.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "She placed the vase on the table.": "audio/cau/1d15e4fcb59d47c9.mp3", "The books are placed on the shelf.": "audio/cau/06fb713c7971af15.mp3", "We went to Da Nang by plane.": "audio/cau/63039d0916892fcd.mp3", "The plane is in the sky.": "audio/cau/4869873b1647ae5a.mp3", "The camera is positioned above the door.": "audio/cau/1652811452a08c72.mp3", "The school is well positioned.": "audio/cau/e5ab4aab5d376886.mp3", "I prepare my schoolbag every evening.": "audio/cau/71ebd7177f9dc1f3.mp3", "Preparation is important, so we prepare for the test carefully.": "audio/cau/3c4561b5af8ea83d.mp3", "What is the price of this book?": "audio/cau/8077f94f42e8b72e.mp3", "The price is too high.": "audio/cau/283a62cf03cde6ba.mp3", "She won first prize in the writing contest.": "audio/cau/a73c772f8c47bafb.mp3", "He received many awards, and this prize is the most famous.": "audio/cau/ca86f5c44e6bd7ac.mp3", "The festival promotes local food.": "audio/cau/2261d9d6f0d584e7.mp3", "Reading promotes creativity.": "audio/cau/5580110e9e130ed0.mp3", "'She' is a pronoun.": "audio/cau/8df898d5c8c5a4a0.mp3", "Use a pronoun instead of the name.": "audio/cau/1a5fd9dce2ba8103.mp3", "Let's practise pronunciation: /b/ and /p/.": "audio/cau/fe10978f3f45d336.mp3", "Pronounce the words carefully to improve your pronunciation.": "audio/cau/69ee019cb8468b45.mp3", "These shoes are of high quality.": "audio/cau/4618ad6c7715b1e8.mp3", "The air quality is poor today.": "audio/cau/d796826ebffea45e.mp3", "The teacher asks us three questions.": "audio/cau/9e7c27a7a37e13a0.mp3", "Read the questions carefully and write your answers.": "audio/cau/7fcc03272c2a6124.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "The Amazon is a huge rainforest.": "audio/cau/a16043034f89a016.mp3", "Many animals live in the rainforest.": "audio/cau/d8850a414c6ee2a5.mp3", "We're playing in the park now.": "audio/cau/ce568c1634d30075.mp3", "They're my friends, and they are very kind.": "audio/cau/aea78a52a03a937e.mp3", "We visit our relatives at Tet.": "audio/cau/179ae79e322f820d.mp3", "She is a relative of mine.": "audio/cau/23394199509709af.mp3", "Do you remember Mi's birthday?": "audio/cau/32d012431282fc9b.mp3", "Remember to bring your book; don't forget it!": "audio/cau/b5bf1b42faeeef1f.mp3", "Listen and repeat the words.": "audio/cau/a50278163c989459.mp3", "Please repeat it; repetition helps us remember.": "audio/cau/43cefd1dcd1c0767.mp3", "Report your group's ideas to the class.": "audio/cau/6522433ccfce4976.mp3", "The reporter wrote a report about our village.": "audio/cau/136adff9e04b464a.mp3", "We had dinner at a restaurant.": "audio/cau/2d6c0a016ebc69ef.mp3", "This restaurant serves good pho.": "audio/cau/4390ddbb6912136e.mp3", "Rewrite the sentences using the words given.": "audio/cau/803847764ed2304d.mp3", "Lan rewrote her essay after the teacher's comments.": "audio/cau/4be7c7706058675e.mp3", "He is a rich man.": "audio/cau/94ae2901b2b5cb7b.mp3", "Vietnam has a rich culture.": "audio/cau/549692b165e5c98f.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "Da Nang is famous for fresh seafood.": "audio/cau/834e37db483f266a.mp3", "I can't eat seafood because of allergies.": "audio/cau/3a3fea404f3ed3da.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "My aunt serves customers at her shop.": "audio/cau/e92a07bd2df4dc4a.mp3", "This dish serves four people.": "audio/cau/bc37764f5dea9a94.mp3", "Our community has many useful services.": "audio/cau/19ca6c712683de55.mp3", "The delivery service brings food to our door.": "audio/cau/4e341b21b0b389e5.mp3", "New York has many skyscrapers.": "audio/cau/1903806d1dbfd6f9.mp3", "Skyscrapers make the city look modern.": "audio/cau/662e17b1ee197bc1.mp3", "The bus is slow at rush hour.": "audio/cau/732f025c97062de8.mp3", "Drivers should slow down near the school gate.": "audio/cau/80ba3032c253c920.mp3", "I eat a snack after school.": "audio/cau/22fc71372a51324a.mp3", "Fruit is a healthy snack.": "audio/cau/bc652af37aac4a59.mp3", "See you soon at school, Mi!": "audio/cau/fec53904fbd07d51.mp3", "The bus will arrive shortly, so we'll be home soon.": "audio/cau/b92c6bf10bdd4a35.mp3", "She is a good English speaker.": "audio/cau/ad8983e10a3153eb.mp3", "Turn up the speaker, please.": "audio/cau/176c25890d4baf0b.mp3", "There are millions of English speakers.": "audio/cau/f4d91f7adbcfc0c3.mp3", "The speakers in the hall are very loud.": "audio/cau/faa61d0c170e4289.mp3", "The speaker speaks clearly and slowly.": "audio/cau/1415c22f6d3f2dc3.mp3", "Mi speaks English well; she spoke to a tourist yesterday.": "audio/cau/699bf193b15f2ef0.mp3", "Bun cha is a speciality of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/a2c2b048e7347b92.mp3", "This cake is special; it is a speciality of Hue.": "audio/cau/e7c18f248052be04.mp3", "Exercise can help you reduce stress.": "audio/cau/22e33d982d8aa525.mp3", "Exams are stressful, so many students feel stressed.": "audio/cau/bf9649e515e0312c.mp3", "Each student has a book, and all the students love our teacher.": "audio/cau/04de8679f0e55800.mp3", "We often go to the beach in summer.": "audio/cau/3330dd1c522a12fd.mp3", "Summer is hot, but winter is cold in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ed399e7b44a56a6e.mp3", "Are you sure about the answer?": "audio/cau/ef07776b14f2052d.mp3", "Nam is sure, but Mi is unsure about it.": "audio/cau/ab6bc930801198f7.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Our English teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/4869000a32bce322.mp3", "Ms Hoa taught us maths last year; she is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/01cfa396481f53ff.mp3", "Mr Phong teaches us how to make pottery.": "audio/cau/b810d8c5f8302b58.mp3", "She teaches maths now; last year she taught science.": "audio/cau/2dc58c5f8f5cc111.mp3", "Can I use your telephone, please?": "audio/cau/aa7a5d67add41cf4.mp3", "Alexander Graham Bell invented the telephone.": "audio/cau/38ca1e3fa8439b54.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "If you stay up too late tonight, you might feel tired tomorrow morning.": "audio/cau/a274d7c5c51d23e2.mp3", "Nam has a maths test tomorrow.": "audio/cau/6e56cc1d2ea4fcbd.mp3", "My top priority this week is the English test.": "audio/cau/8193cd55a97916bf.mp3", "Homework is Mai's top priority after school.": "audio/cau/3fb4be7e1f965a3d.mp3", "We went on a tour of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/b1aef3993b1d87cd.mp3", "The bus tour starts at 8 a.m.": "audio/cau/dd11943cd2068c0b.mp3", "They are touring Europe this month.": "audio/cau/ad047e3e8b295d27.mp3", "We enjoyed touring the countryside by bike.": "audio/cau/72f1536fe2eafe07.mp3", "Tourism is important to Da Nang.": "audio/cau/66c18d8036dc4cca.mp3", "Eco-tourism helps protect nature.": "audio/cau/e2cac58b1dc37552.mp3", "A tourist asked me the way to the lake.": "audio/cau/85504a3dd570c415.mp3", "Tourism is important, and every tourist loves our pho.": "audio/cau/28ec58cef47dd36f.mp3", "Trekkers love the mountains in Ha Giang.": "audio/cau/e2b3fea042252c44.mp3", "The trekkers stopped for lunch by a stream.": "audio/cau/51a94e68fe5417dc.mp3", "Let's try this new game, Nam!": "audio/cau/9540039a577e2fee.mp3", "Hoa tried hard, and she didn't give up.": "audio/cau/deeed17a1fca8206.mp3", "Read the underlined words aloud.": "audio/cau/6c18e837ccd3be90.mp3", "Please underline the verbs; Nam's underlined words are correct.": "audio/cau/bc51496fa725ab91.mp3", "Do you understand the question, Hoa?": "audio/cau/4aad582adc859dab.mp3", "Minh understood the lesson, but Lan didn't understand it.": "audio/cau/d720b04327d8be8a.mp3", "Today we are reviewing Unit 2.": "audio/cau/4cbb6e6ec2608275.mp3", "This unit is about houses, and the next unit is about friends.": "audio/cau/654b123e0b65a71f.mp3", "Nam grew up in a small village.": "audio/cau/40830ead9e37bc73.mp3", "Lan walked up the hill and then came down.": "audio/cau/815acf6571d188ca.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "She is using a computer to write her story.": "audio/cau/c0867dfe4d3cf7aa.mp3", "Minh used a map yesterday, and today he is using his phone.": "audio/cau/2f51e71c740b9c6e.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "There are many varieties of rice in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/b433c266248349f4.mp3", "This shop sells different varieties of tea.": "audio/cau/4edc60de6e5a741f.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "The view from my window is beautiful.": "audio/cau/a2cd78af04fe64cc.mp3", "In my view, homework is useful.": "audio/cau/1db29f08206967db.mp3", "My grandparents live in a small village.": "audio/cau/959ff3761670ea0d.mp3", "The villagers in our village grow rice.": "audio/cau/c5c92b3fc554d83c.mp3", "Visit our website for more information.": "audio/cau/ac9737600d9243d7.mp3", "Phong visited his grandparents, and they enjoyed his visit.": "audio/cau/24f2a12ad9734414.mp3", "The ship made a long voyage across the ocean.": "audio/cau/2f53f3f311170c0a.mp3", "Columbus's voyage took many weeks.": "audio/cau/7193bb6ce038eada.mp3", "Nam wanted to make new friends.": "audio/cau/a46c042f58d31655.mp3", "Mai wanted more time to play games.": "audio/cau/108dbb361308f97d.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "This is the best way to learn new words.": "audio/cau/22b4d6bd5dcffca6.mp3", "Can you show me the way to the museum?": "audio/cau/a9eaac6ad2044743.mp3", "I play football twice a week.": "audio/cau/f42675610892504d.mp3", "Every week we have a weekly test.": "audio/cau/9b6cd05f35e45234.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "I will help you with your homework.": "audio/cau/09b1efdcdb577f02.mp3", "Lan will visit us tomorrow, but Nam won't come.": "audio/cau/b87ff8c1b6e3e1d4.mp3", "Our class won the football match.": "audio/cau/bb3e58a3b26e4b6d.mp3", "Mi wants to win again because she won last year.": "audio/cau/e74989f2bc32f179.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "She was one of the most famous scientists in the world.": "audio/cau/60bcc9b6651e1a00.mp3", "Pho is famous all over the world.": "audio/cau/5cc0d2280fff73e9.mp3", "Would you like to live here?": "audio/cau/648fc211b3b7e91a.mp3", "I would like a villa with a big garden.": "audio/cau/af8db0397bcb6281.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "I visited my grandparents yesterday.": "audio/cau/b70c01cfaeef2141.mp3", "Yesterday was Monday, so tomorrow is Wednesday.": "audio/cau/f2b6a596e763d873.mp3"};
